DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T181500
UID:260605h-gDq1Z3EUy77GoKSyLCWw
DESCRIPTION:AHA PALS Certification Class \\(Blended Learning\\)\n\nPediatr
 ic Advanced Life Support\n\nAmerican Heart Association \\(AHA\\) PALS cert
 ification Blended Learning class \\(online course plus in-person Skills Se
 ssion\\). This class is appropriate for initial PALS certification or PALS
  renewal. American Heart Association PALS Provider certifications are issu
 ed on the same day.\n\nLearn from a top-rated\, local CPR training company
  with over 1\,000 5-star reviews! Our classes are fun\, engaging\, and exp
