BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tap In Fridays | Bay Area Vibes at Barrel Proof Lounge | Santa Ros
 a
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T010000
UID:260717eG29jTBzpk69WsOawU5l_Q
DESCRIPTION:Tap into Bay Area vibes with DJ Juice Bokz\, karaoke\, drinks\
 , and good people at Barrel Proof Lounge in Downtown Santa Rosa.\n\nJoin u
 s every last Friday of the month as Barrel Proof Lounge transforms into th
 e spot for Bay Area music\, good people\, and late-night energy. After the
  laughs wrap up in the showroom\, the party keeps going in the lounge with
  DJ Juice Bokz spinning a mix of hip-hop\, R&B\, throwbacks\, and Bay Area
  favorites all night long. Meanwhile\, the main room stays open with karao
 ke\, giving you two ways to spend your Friday night.\n\nThink of it as the
  perfect afterparty: -Grab a drink. -Meet some new people. -Sing your hear
 t out. -Dance until last call.\n\nNo velvet ropes. No pretension. Just a r
 oom full of good vibes and familiar faces. Tap In Fridays -Every Last Frid
 ay -Bay Area Vibes -Good Music • Good People • Good Times\n\nEvent Det
 ails - Friday\, July 24\, 2026 - Doors Open: 9:00 PM - DJ Starts: 10:00 PM
  - Barrel Proof Lounge -501 Mendocino Ave. -Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nFeaturi
 ng -DJ Juice Bokz in the Lounge -Karaoke in the Main Showroom -Drink Speci
 als -Free Popcorn -21+\n\nBring your crew\, make some memories\, and tap i
 nto one of Downtown Santa Rosa's newest monthly traditions.\n\nCheck out *
 *www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/tap-in-fridays-bay-area-vibes-at-barrel-p
 roof-lounge-santa-rosa-tickets-1994279439488?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Social Contractors Return To Rock Murphy's Irish Pub
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260724T213000
UID:260716LJH90CE-O0OlfSWALV-_DA
DESCRIPTION:“….Get ready for the super-entertaining sounds of local ba
 nd The Social Contractors. They totally rock\, in all the right ways…”
  - Argus-Courier\n\nJoin The Social Contractors as they return to rock Mur
 phy's Irish Pub with an evening of upbeat original rock and their own spin
  on classic hits you know and love.\n\nWhether you like melodic vocals\, s
 earing guitar and sax solos\, intriguing lyrics\, captivating songs\, or j
 ust great dynamic and danceable rhythms\, The Social Contractors won't dis
 appoint.\n\nThe Social Contractors lineup for this free live performance f
 eatures band founder and songwriter\, Jason E Davies (lead vocals\, lead/r
 hythm guitar)\, Travis Thayer (sax/keys/vocals)\, Alex Fabian-Davies (bass
 )\, and Nick Schneider (drums).\n\nLocated in the heart of historic downto
 wn Sonoma\, Murphy's Irish Pub is the place to be for a lively atmosphere 
 of music\, social merriment\, a diverse menu of delicious food\, and satis
 fying full bar beverage options.
LOCATION:Murphy's Irish Pub & Restaurant
