DESCRIPTION:Join us on **Friday\, July 24 from 5:30–8:00pm** for our ne
 xt **Pour + Explore: Sonoma Valley**. Perched above the rolling hills and
  vineyards of Sonoma Valley\, the stunning **Ram’s Gate Winery** provi
 des an unforgettable setting for this relaxed walk-around tasting celebrat
 ing the distinctive wines and winemaking heritage of the Sonoma Valley AVA
 . Meet representatives from acclaimed Sonoma Valley wineries as you sip a 
 curated selection of wines and enjoy complimentary light appetizers prepar
 ed by the Ram’s Gate culinary team in one of Sonoma County’s most pict
 uresque settings. The evening will also feature live music from **Jacob P
 hilip Benning**\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a summer evening in 
 wine country.\n\nPresented by Sonoma County Vintners in collaboration with
  Sommelier Christopher Sawyer\, this thoughtfully curated evening offers a
 n opportunity to experience the beauty\, character\, and exceptional wines
  that have made Sonoma Valley one of California’s most celebrated wine r
 egions.
