 vorites\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a relaxed and social evening
  surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s wines
  by the glass or bottle while Mamadios Philly serves their signature Phila
 delphia-style cheesesteaks and hearty favorites\, made fresh on site.\n\nF
 riday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-21 
 event inside the Barrel Room. Under-21 guests and leashed pets are welcome
  on the patio only.\n\nCome grab a seat early and enjoy a classic Sonoma C
 ounty night of great music\, great wine\, and great food.\n\nWine availabl
 e for purchase Live music by Highway 12 Band Food by Mamadios Philly \\(Ph
 iladelphia-style cheesesteaks and comfort fare\\) Location: Longboard Vine
 yards Barrel Room Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
