BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SEAWOLF Wines Pop-Up Tasting at Gospel Flat Farm in Bolinas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T170000
UID:260722LVh61JxZD0iH7kev9O_naw
DESCRIPTION:SEAWOLF Wines Pop-Up Tasting in Bolinas Saturday\, July 25th 
 1:00 PM to 5:00PM\n\nPerched among the rugged ridgelines of Anderson Valle
 y\, SEAWOLF Wines is a family-owned winery founded by two passionate winem
 akers who bring the same fearless spirit to their wine grape growing as th
 ey do to the waves. Dedicated to organic farming and natural winemaking\, 
 Jesse and Emma embrace a minimal-intervention philosophy\, allowing each v
 intage to reflect the intimate relationship between time\, nature\, and la
 nd.\n\nWine crafted with intention. Shaped by nature. Inspired by adventur
 e.\n\nJoin Us in Bolinas\n\nWhether you've just finished an early morning 
 surf at Bolinas\, hiked the ridgelines of Mount Tamalpais\, or explored Hi
 ghway 1 by bike\, we invite you to slow down and spend the afternoon with 
 us! Join us at Gospel Flat Farm\, overlooking the beautiful Bolinas Lagoon
 \, for a tasting of our organically grown\, dry-farmed wines in one of Wes
 t Marin's most scenic settings.\n\nEnjoy:\n\nA guided tasting of handcraft
 ed natural wines\n\nFresh organic vegetables available for purchase from t
 he Gospel Flat Farm stand\n\nAdmission $20 per guest\n\nComplimentary for 
 Wine Club members\n\nLocation\n\nGospel Flat Farm204 Olema Bolinas Road\n\
 nBolinas\, CA\n\nWe can't wait to share our wines—and an unforgettable a
 fternoon—with you in Bolinas.\n\nPhotography by Laura Kudritzki
LOCATION:Gospel Flat Farm
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/seawolfwines/event/615772/seawolf-wines-po
 p-up-tasting-at-gospel-flat-farm-in-bolinas
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
