DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T123000
UID:2607143Dk7ZTUon0Wqy9DhdAGCzA
DESCRIPTION:Discover the magic of traditional Japanese fermentation in thi
 s hands-on workshop with chef and teacher **Hiroko Kurosaki**. Together we
 ’ll explore the art of miso and koji\, two foundational elements of Japa
 nese cuisine that bring depth\, flavor\, and nourishment to everyday meals
 .\n\nIn this class\, you will:\n\n• Make your own **fresh miso** to fer
 ment at home\n\n• Create **two jars of seasonal vegetable ferments** wit
 h salt koji\n\n• Taste the sweetness of traditional **amazake**\n\n• L
 eave with **the knowledge and confidence** to continue your fermenting pra
 ctice at home\n\nLearn time-honored fermentation techniques and bring a pi
 ece of Japanese food tradition into your own kitchen.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://gathersebastopol.com/products/miso-koji-a-japanese-fermentatio
 n-workshop
