BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ceramic Carving - Vases
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T130000
UID:260401dVa3PJKG9E2vqz0KqWW7mg
DESCRIPTION:Join Kelly from No Peach Ceramics for a hands-on ceramic carvi
 ng class. \n\nSgraffito is an ancient technique of surface decoration tha
 t involves scratching or carving through a layer to reveal a contrasting c
 olor beneath. \n\n During the course of this 3 hour workshop\, we will c
 over the fundamentals of which tools and techniques to best to apply (and 
 then remove) slips and underglazes to a pre-prepared clay "canvas". Demons
 trations of when and how to carve successfully will be supplemented with i
 n-depth advice on each aspect of the sgraffito process. \n\n All experie
 nce levels are welcome! You will be provided with materials\, tools\, and 
 forms to practice sgraffito and make your own unique platter. Bringing ins
 piration photos and design ideas is welcomed and encouraged! We will be pr
 oviding one pre-prepared raw clay platter per student to use during the co
 urse. After the class\, we will fire your finished piece and it will be re
 ady for pick up within 2-3 weeks.
LOCATION:Art Escape
URL:https://artescapesonoma.jumbula.com/Summer2026/CeramicCarvingVases
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
