UID:260716gka_QP4jrUKuvPjU58tSmg
DESCRIPTION:Marin Center presents Roller Disco Daze\, a free community rol
 ler skating experience on Lagoon Island at the Marin County Fairgrounds. R
 unning Wednesdays through Sundays\, July 17 through August 16\, the rink i
 s open to all ages and skill levels\, with themed nights every Friday\, Sa
 turday\, and Sunday to keep things lively all summer long. \n\nSkate bene
 ath a disco ball surrounded by the lagoon\, then cool down with lawn games
 \, explore art installations by local artists on display\, and don't miss 
 the giant inflatable skate for the ultimate photo opp. A DJ spins on-site 
 beginning at 12 pm every Friday-Sunday to keep the music on point and the 
 vibes rolling. Food from Manny's Tacos will be on-site all days of the eve
 nt\, and Lobo's Ice Cream will be available July 17-19 and July 24-26.\n\n
 Admission is free. Skate rentals\, including kids' sizes\, are available o
 n-site for $5. All skaters must sign a waiver\; skaters under 18 require a
  parent or guardian signature.
LOCATION:Lagoon Island\, Marin County Fairgrounds
URL:https://marincenter.marincounty.gov/node/306
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Heart-opening Cacao Ceremony & Yoga at Sea Ranch Lodge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T123000
UID:260716Y05xWTM8iUqSktHUDfiAOA
DESCRIPTION:Join us at The Sea Ranch Lodge for an unforgettable experience
 . Tap into new levels of joy as you open your heart and tune into your sen
 ses during an ancestral Cacao Ceremony led by Charlotte Keane and Heart Op
 ening yoga session led by Shoshana Hebshi.The ceremonial cacao drink will 
 be prepared and consumed in the ritual shared by Charlotte’s ancestors. 
 As a plant medicine\, cacao itself calls us to share her loving energy wit
 h others. Paired with drums\, rattles\, and movement you will be able to t
 ap into new levels of joy and exhilaration. Priestess Charlotte brings rit
 ual and ceremonial customs from her family in Mexico\, Central and South A
 merica. She is a healer\, shaman\, curandera\, and ordained priestess in t
 he Order of the Magdalene. Shoshana is the founder and owner of Revolution
  Yoga in Santa Rosa. She has been practicing yoga for more than 20 years\,
  and as an instructor aims to nurture the same spirit of joy\, connection 
 and calmness that was lit for her by her teachers.
LOCATION:The Sea Ranch Lodge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/heart-opening-cacao-ceremony-yoga-at-sea-
 ranch-lodge-tickets-1987654906331
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
