BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TAKE YOUR TIME: Oil Pintings by Sharon Eisley
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T170000
UID:2605291R9440eisUaXuh65QEimIQ
DESCRIPTION:“Take Your Time”\n\nChange and transformation take time. I
 n her newest oil paintings Sharon Eisley explores the time as a process. B
 e it moving through grief\, re-framing your story of self\, or birthing so
 me new creation\, each painting lures you in with beautiful application th
 en holds you in time for a closer examination of our human experience. Eis
 ley's paintings are all inspired by tarot cards and her personal journey. 
 Tarot readings will be offered at the reception by @SymbolWarehouse for an
  optional small donation.\n\nOur guest artist\, Robert Benson\, will be ch
 allenging your eyes to fill in the details with his impressionist watercol
 ors.\n\nThis June 20th reception will be the FINAL art opening for Sebasto
 pol Gallery in its home of almost 20 years! This show may last only throug
 h June 2026\, then move to our new location. Or it may be up through June 
 and July. Either way\, this will be your last chance to come celebrate our
  local\, amazing group of artists at 150 N Main St.. “Take Your Time” 
 is a reminder to our collective to take our time finding and setting up ou
 r new home for all of you. I hope you can all come celebrate all the time 
 and art we shared with you in our lovely gallery.\n\nwww.sharoneisley.com
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:"With A Song in My Heart" - A Celebration of Rodgers and Hart
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260726T180000
UID:26052042c5ed0TJUuJ6cl6kXelIg
DESCRIPTION:The Music in Place Cabaret is comprised of leading stars of t
 he Bay Area Theater world. The core talent group consists of musical comed
 y veterans Ken Stegmiller\, Rodney Jackson\, Jocelyn Thompson-Jordan\, Ann
 emarie Ballinger\, and musical director\, Frederick Hodges. Each performer
  has enjoyed a whirlwind career on stage here and abroad and have all garn
 ered fame\, awards\, and accolades from the press and from fans alike for 
 their ebullient personalities\, musical talent\, charm\, grace\, and stage
  appeal.\n\nAt present\, the group has on offer three musical revues\, cel
 ebrating the genius of America’s finest composers. Additional revues wil
 l be added to the repertoire. Each will delight audiences with the brillia
 nt and beloved melodies of other noted composers whose work has earned a p
 lace in the musical hall of fame.\n\n“With A Song in My Heart” - A Cel
 ebration of Rodgers and Hart\n\nA joyous celebration of the stellar talent
 s of the musical team of Richard Rodgers and Lorenz Hart\, two college boy
 s who lit up Broadway with their urbane wit and sophistication. Our talent
 ed cast will delight you with favorites such as “Blue Moon” and other 
 classics from the ground-breaking Broadway and Hollywood creations of thes
 e two legends of American music.
LOCATION:Sonoma Valley Museum of Art
URL:https://musicinplace.org/event/with-a-song-in-my-heart-rodgers-and-har
 t-in-sonoma/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
