DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260728T110000
UID:260624Fwuyc4PjIUydmCUkRWV4Hw
DESCRIPTION:Discover the Power of Mat Pilates!\n\nLooking for a low-impact
  way to completely transform how your body looks and feels? Our standard M
 at Pilates class is designed to build core strength\, improve posture\, an
 d tone your entire body using nothing but your own body weight.\n\nNo fanc
 y studio equipment required—just you\, a mat\, and your determination!\n
 \nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nTotal Body Toning: Sculpt and strengthen your 
 muscles from head to toe.\n\nWeight Management: Burn calories and boost y
 our metabolism with controlled\, purposeful movements.\n\nTargeted Results
 : Easily modify exercises to focus on the specific areas you want to im
 prove.\n\nPerfect for All Levels: Start using just your body weight\, and
  we’ll help you progress and develop at your own pace.\n\nReady to stand
  taller and feel stronger? Grab your mat and let’s move!\n\nTuesdays 10:
 00 am
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/pilates/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Women's Journaling & Sharing Circle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260728T104500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260728T121500
UID:260615dLgb-n7xG0yuHytlSGlAiA
DESCRIPTION:We will use short writing prompts designed to encourage you to
  let your unconscious lead\, creating space for insight and personal refle
 ction. This is a gentle\, supportive space for reflection\, connection\, a
 nd authentic sharing. There is no right way to participate—you're invite
 d to share as much or as little as feels comfortable.\n\nBring a journal\,
  an open heart\, and curiosity for the journey ahead. I look forward to ga
 thering with you and creating a meaningful experience together.\n\nBegins 
 June 23rd at 10:45am-12:15pm Please email me at www.empoweringchange@sonic
 .net with any questions\n\nNo writing experience is needed\, just a willin
 gness to show up and explore. $25 per group session.\n\nFacilitated by May
 a Dincin\, MA\, founder of Empowering Change Counseling
LOCATION:Private Counseling Office
URL:https://empoweringchangecounseling.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
