BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sunset Socials at Montgomery Village
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T190000
UID:260715S2pJN5RczEOw1ApNEv8Kuw
DESCRIPTION:*Every month this summer | The Terrace at Fieldwork*\n\nSunset
  Socials is our monthly summer gathering at The Terrace\, a relaxed\, come
 -as-you-are evening where neighbors can slow down\, connect\, and enjoy ev
 erything that makes this community worth celebrating. Grab a table or a se
 at by the fire pit\, order food and drinks from Fieldwork\, located right
  next door\, and settle in for an evening of live music from local musicia
 n Hannah Jern-Miller while the sun goes down. Browse handmade goods and cu
 rated finds from local vendors\, and enjoy kids’ activities for the litt
 le ones hosted by The Zones\, a local nonprofit youth center.\n\nPlus\, S
 age B Willow Farm will be on site with fresh\, pesticide-free seasonal blo
 oms from their Sebastopol flower farm. $25 Farm Bunches (wrapped and ready
 ) are available for pre order here and can be picked up at the event. Yo
 u can also mix and match your favorites\, or let us help you put together 
 a beautiful bouquet of dahlia stems and seasonal flowers for $2.00 per dah
 lia while supplies last.\n\n**Order in Advance Recommended**\n\nThis event
  is free and open to the public. No registration needed.\n\nJoin us for Su
 nset Socials on **Thursday\, July 30th**. Come early\, stay late\, and br
 ing the whole family. Even furry friends are welcome at The Terrace.\n\nCa
 n’t make it in July? Our next event is scheduled for Thursday\, August 2
 7th.
LOCATION:Fieldwork
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/sunset-socials-at-montgomery-vil
 lage/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
