BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Sip & Support at Cuvaison Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260731T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260731T190000
UID:260607876Bi371U0641kxeV9-A8A
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the height of summer with an afternoon of wine\, com
 munity\, and connection at Cuvaison’s Los Carneros estate. Summer Sip & 
 Support is a relaxed walkaround tasting featuring a curated lineup of wine
 ry partners pouring alongside Cuvaison’s estate-grown selections. Stroll
  the beautiful grounds\, discover wines from across the region\, and shop 
 artisanal goods from local purveyors.\n\nThis festive walkaround tasting f
 eatures wines from Cuvaison\, alongside fellow wineries Ancien\, Earthshin
 e\, and Brandlin Estate\, each pouring a selection of their current releas
 es.\n\nShop handmade goods and seasonal treats from local vendors includin
 g Panevino\, B&B Gardens\, Scarlata Farms\, Bare Rooted Gardens\, Glass We
 ll Drinks\, 3.p.art\, and Star Crossed Jewelry.\n\nPlus\, this year Cuvais
 on partnered with Canine Companions\, who will be on-site with a few of th
 e service dogs in training — stop by and say hello! Canine Companions le
 ads the service dog industry\, empowering clients\, and their dogs to live
  with greater independence. The organization provides service dogs to adul
 ts\, children\, and veterans with disabilities\, as well as facility dogs 
 to professionals working in healthcare\, criminal justice\, and educationa
 l settings. Founded in 1975\, Canine Companions provides its dogs and all 
 follow‑up services at no cost to its clients.\n\nRaise a glass to summer
 \, support local businesses\, and a great cause. Join anytime between 4pm 
 and 7pm. We look forward to seeing you to celebrate and support our commun
 ity!
LOCATION:Cuvaison Winery
URL:https://tewines.com/pages/cuvaison-events 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Much Ado About Nothing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260731T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260731T193000
UID:260602n0-OKC6O-USmL9OSykk2WQ
DESCRIPTION:**It’s Shakespeare in the Piazza at Bacchus Landing**!\n\nWh
 ile Claudio and Hero fall in love and get engaged\, the villainous Don Joh
 n tricks Claudio into believing Hero is unfaithful\, leading him to public
 ly humiliate her at the altar. Meanwhile\, their friends conspire to make 
 the sparring Beatrice and Benedick fall in love\, and they eventually conf
 ess their feelings for each other. The play’s climax\, in pure Shakespea
 rean form\, involves a faked death\, a confession of Don John’s plot\, a
 nd a happy ending with a double wedding – of course!\n\nBacchus Landing
 ’s wood-fired pizza will be available for purchase\, and wine by the gla
 ss or bottle will also be available for purchase from selected wineries ea
 ch evening (see the schedule\, below). **Sorry\, no outside food or drink
  allowed except for water bottles.** Remember\, Sonoma County evenings ge
 t chilly even in the summer. We advise you to bring a sweater\, jacket\, o
 r hoodie in case you need to bundle up after sunset!\n\nJuly 23rd\, 24th\,
  25th\, 30th\, 31st\; August 1st\, 6th\, 7th. 7:30 pm.\n\nBy William Shake
 speare Directed by Steven David Martin Running time: 2:15 hours Doors open
  at 6:30 pm. **Come early to enjoy Bacchus Landing wood-fired pizza and s
 elect wines!** Free parking is available and the premises are wheelchair-a
 ccessible.
LOCATION:Bacchus Landing 
URL:https://raventheater.org/events/much-ado-about-nothing/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
