DESCRIPTION:Westerly is an indie-folk\, rock band formed around the songs 
 of singer and guitarist Sterling Spence. Originating in the San Francisco 
 Bay Area\, the five-piece has spread across the state and performs regular
 ly in both the Bay Area and Los Angeles. Storytellers at heart\, Westerly 
 writes about spirituality\, love\, and the state of the world. Though they
  integrate roots influences\, the band is expressly not a retrospective. T
 heir sound brings contemporary flourishes that often give nod to the R&B\,
  punk\, and indie rock scenes that have characterized the West Coast music
 al landscape of free love\, passion\, and protest.
