SUMMARY:Workshop: Introduction to Letterpress
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T150000
UID:260713bfEOC9kohUCGrJ1w85KGfA
DESCRIPTION:Get hands-on with the art of letterpress in this beginner-frie
 ndly workshop. We'll explore the basics of printing on a press\, from sett
 ing up a design to inking and pulling your very first prints. Along the wa
 y\, you'll learn about the history of letterpress\, the different kinds of
  presses\, and the tools and materials that bring this centuries-old craft
  to life. Each participant will work together to create collaborative prin
 ts to take home-while experiencing the unique textures and tactile beauty 
 that only letterpress can offer. No prior experience required-just bring y
 our creativity and a willingness to get inky! first saturdays 10:00a - 3:0
 0p
LOCATION:D
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/workshop-introduction-to-letterpress/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
