SUMMARY:Expressions in Metal: Panel Discussion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T163000
UID:260722EHij_gLcn0-Ct8xg5ZFkBQ
DESCRIPTION:This afternoon panel brings together 5 featured metal artists 
 in conversation with moderator David Duskin for a dynamic exploration of t
 he ideas and processes shaping contemporary metalwork.  The discussion off
 ers a rare opportunity to hear directly from the artists about how they na
 vigate the balance between discipline and innovation. Through dialogue and
  audience questions\, the conversation will reveal the diverse ways artist
 s are pushing the boundaries of metalwork while honoring its deep craft tr
 aditions\, illuminating how these works carry both personal and collective
  histories.\n\nModerator: David Duskin    \n\nParticipating Artists: Micha
 el McGinnis\, Martin Munson\, James Ford Grant\, Ray Degischer\, Byron B. 
 Kim\, J. Nick Taylor\n\n 
LOCATION:Petaluma Arts Center
