BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sturgeon’s Mill Open Demonstration Run
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T150000
UID:260610ach2QECNRk6iGctRHKtiWg
DESCRIPTION:Step into a true piece of California history at Sturgeon’s M
 ill\, a fully operational **steam-powered sawmill founded in 1914**. Unlik
 e a replica\, this is an authentic working museum where the **original mac
 hinery still runs today**\, offering a rare chance to see early 20th-centu
 ry industry in action.\n\n**Dates:** June 20-21 | August 1-2 | September 1
 2-13\n\n**Time:** 10:00 AM - 3:00 PM (crew breaks for lunch 12:00 PM -1:00
  PM)\n\n**Location:** 2150 Green Hill Rd\, Sebastopol\, CA\n\nWatch live s
 team demonstrations as the mill comes to life\, explore historic equipment
 \, and learn how local lumber mills helped build Sonoma County and the gre
 ater Bay Area. Docent-led tours run throughout the day\, or you can explor
 e at your own pace.\n\nCome experience the sights\, sounds\, and stories o
 f a working mill where history still runs on steam.\n\n**Highlights:**\n\n
 Live operation of a historic steam-powered sawmill\n\nAll-original equipme
 nt from over 100 years ago\n\nGuided tours and hands-on exploration\n\nBla
 cksmith shop\, gardens\, and farm animals\n\nFood available for purchase f
 rom the cook shack\n\nBring a picnic and enjoy the beautiful redwood setti
 ng\n\n**Good to Know:**\n\nAdmission is **free - no tickets required**\n\n
 Donations are appreciated to support preservation\n\nFree parking availabl
 e on site.
LOCATION:Sturgeon's Mill
URL:http://www.sturgeonsmill.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
