DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T200000
UID:260722mSMLq_i0pUS-DxYrys56-g
DESCRIPTION:OUTSIDE\, RAIN OR SHINE. Blue Note Napa Summer Sessions are he
 ld at The Meritage Resort and Spa\, located at 850 Bordeaux Way\, Napa 945
 58. The Sapphire Club Section offers reserved seating with a table and 2 c
 hairs\, sold in units of 2 only. Price is per seat\, not per table\, and i
 ncludes access to the Club Lounge with a cash bar and A/C. The Gold & Silv
 er Sections have reserved seating\, while the Bronze Lawn Section is stand
 ing room only\; blankets are okay\, but no chairs are allowed. All prices 
 are per person\, and each patron requires a ticket for entry. Ages 8\\+ on
 ly\, no infants. Food & drinks are available for purchase. All tickets are
  pre-purchased and will be available in your Ticketmaster account to be sc
 anned for entry. Bathrooms are available. No corkage or outside food/drink
 \, no professional cameras\, no smoking\, and service animals only. Visit 
 our website for our bag policy and more FAQs. Parking is available for pur
 chase at $18 in advance or $25 day of show. ALL SALES ARE FINAL.
LOCATION:Blue Note Napa Summer Sessions
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/995409673204227/?acontext=%7B%22event_
 action_history%22%3A[%7B%22mechanism%22%3A%22lov_feed%22%2C%22surface%22%3
 A%22bookmark%22%7D]%2C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
