BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Steven Cade
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T000000
UID:260224knCnSRf8zUGKQjOkkAPE8w
DESCRIPTION:Steven Cade is an award-winning\, Nashville-based\, modern cou
 ntry artist and singer/songwriter. He was born in Texas and arrived to Nas
 hville by way of California. Cade has captivated and energized crowds acro
 ss North America with his signature sound. He infuses contemporary pop ele
 ments into country- influenced songs\, creating a unique slant on traditio
 nal country music. “My goal is to write\, create\, and perform music tha
 t speaks to people about everyday life\, inspires and helps them through c
 hallenges\, while spreading a positive message\,” states Cade.” He tou
 rs nationally for his Giving Guitars Foundation to benefit shelters and ag
 encies helping homeless families\, youth\, veterans and those in need.\n\n
 Cade has been considered for 18 GRAMMY nominations. Other accolades includ
 e Awarded Modern Country Artist of the Year at the Grand Ole Opry\, W.A.M.
  Country Music Award\, the Durango Songwriter’s Expo\, and ‘Best Count
 ry’ at the Wine Country Music Awards. “What I Really Want to Say” to
 pped the New Country Artist Radio chart at \\#1 for 4 weeks\, and the vide
 o aired on GAC and Heartland. Cade’s CD\, What I Really Want to Say\, de
 buted in the iTunes Top 100 Country Chart.\n\nCade has co-written with ind
 ustry notables such as Liz Hengber\, \\(Sara Evans\, Reba\, Brooks & Dunn\
 \)\, Byron Hill \\(George Strait\, George Jones\, Toby Keith\\)\, Skip Bla
 ck \\(LoCash\, Tyler Farr\, Craig Morgan\\)\, Brian Maher \\(Taylor Swift\
 , Emerson Drive\, Justin Moore\\)\, and Jeff Cohen \\(Sugarland\, Big & Ri
 ch\, Santana\\).\n\nCade is a California Music Hall of Fame inductee\, mem
 ber of the Country Music Association\, Academy of Country Music\, and GRAM
 MY Recording Academy. Cade has been featured with Blake Shelton\, Keith Ur
 ban\, Jason Aldean\, Eric Church\, Carrie Underwood\, Darius Rucker\,\, Ga
 vin DeGraw\, and many others.
LOCATION:Wilfred's Lounge
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107984502?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
