DESCRIPTION:Join us for Family Nights 2026 - a relaxed evening that brings
  our community together over seasonal cuisine\, estate-grown wines\, and t
 he effortless charm of wine country living. Begin your night with a glass 
 of welcome bubbles before enjoying a beautifully curated buffet featuring 
 fresh\, flavorful dishes that celebrate the season. With open seating avai
 lable both indoors and outdoors\, you're free to settle in wherever you fe
 el most at home - beneath the twinkle lights\, among the vineyards\, or in
 side our cozy Winery Barn. As a family-owned estate\, we cherish meaningfu
 l moments shared around the table. These evenings invite you to slow down\
 , savor the experience\, and enjoy time with the people you love\, includi
 ng little ones and well-behaved pups. Event Details: Includes: Welcome bub
 bles\, buffet dinner\, and open seating Seating Options: Indoor & outdoor 
 seating available Kid- & Dog-Friendly: Families and well-behaved dogs are 
 welcome Add-On Tickets: Young Adult \\(11-20\\): $35 Child \\(Under 10\\):
  $5 Club Members: Discount automatically applied at checkout Dress Code: C
 asual wine country Dietary Restrictions: We gladly accommodate food allerg
 ies with advance notice so our guests can dine comfortably and safely. We 
 are unable to accommodate personal dietary preferences.Please email events
 @bricoleurvineyards.com in advance Age Requirement: All ages welcome
LOCATION:Bricoleur Vineyards
URL:https://cm.healdsburg.com/events/details/august-family-night-with-bric
 oleur-23750
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
