UID:260703xcdGZUq0hUumU89WYV0zrw
DESCRIPTION:Jacobethan Theatre Workshop presents Caesar\, a free\, modern-
 dress production of Shakespeare’s political tragedy and the fourth seaso
 n of Shakespeare in the Park(ing Lot).\n\nRunning approximately 95 minutes
  without intermission\, Caesar follows the conspiracy against Julius Caesa
 r\, the ensuing assassination\, and the political collapse unleashed by me
 n who believe they are saving the republic.\n\nAt Sonoma Community Center\
 , performances take place outdoors on Saturday\, August 8\, at 7:30 p.m. a
 nd on Sunday\, August 9\, at 3:00 p.m.\n\nAdmission is free. Advance seat 
 reservations are encouraged.\n\nThis touring production also appears at 6t
 h Street Playhouse in Santa Rosa and Life On Art in Petaluma.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://www.jacobethan.org/parking-lot
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
