DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T213000
UID:260625-4c6tQjbkEm1U3YRBdaikQ
DESCRIPTION:A new play by G.B. Lindsay.\n\nOld friends\, Jaycoen \\(Stephe
 n K Patterson\\) and Ougein \\(GB Lindsay\\) wake up to another delightful
  day at the beach as ocean sings and war rages on. But Today enters like n
 o other Yesterday\, for this day has arrived with new twisted turns and bu
 rns\, tucked-up into its sun-worn sleeves. Enter six extraordinary beings 
 \\(mostly Taylor Diffenderfer\\) who will test the limits of their friends
 hip and the inevitability of their fate.\n\nBeached is an absurdist tragic
 omedy in the tradition of Laurel and Hardy\, Beckett\, Kafka\, Tom Stoppar
 d\, and Eric Overmyer.
LOCATION:The Imaginists
URL:https://theimaginists.org/beached-julyaug
