DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260809T160000
UID:260722vavGbeMAWU6LO_And6we7Q
DESCRIPTION:Art Escape is rolling over to Sonoma Botanical Garden with Art
  Van Gogh\, our mobile art studio!\n\nJoin us for crafts and creative fun 
 for all ages. Our wonderful teachers\, Susan & Cristina\, will guide you i
 n creating **Mini Garden Nichos (Matchbox Spirit Shrines)**.\n\nParticipan
 ts will transform small matchboxes into miniature “nichos”—tiny shad
 ow box shrines inspired by Mexican folk art traditions. The outside will b
 e decorated with bright floral borders and bold patterns\, while inside ea
 ch box will hold a small symbolic drawing or cut-out “spirit guide” (a
 nimal\, flower\, sun\, etc.). This quiet\, reflective project invites arti
 sts of all ages to create a personal\, pocket-sized tribute to nature and 
 imagination.\n\nRSVP to us at info@artescapesonoma.com to join for FREE!
LOCATION:Sonoma Botanical Garden
URL:https://artescapesonoma.jumbula.com/Summer2026/ArtVanGoghSundayFundaya
 tSonomaBotanicalGardensAug
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
