  - Kimberly Taylor 2.3. Library Director or Designee Report 2.4. Branch Ma
 nager Report - Sabine Salek 2.5. City Council Liaison Report - John Gurney
  3. APPROVAL OF THE MINUTES OF November 13\, 2025 MEETING \\(deferred from
  December 11 meeting\\). 4. PUBLIC APPEARANCES OR LETTERS An opportunity f
 or members of the public to address the Library Advisory Board\; times are
  limited at the Chair's discretion. 5. DISCUSSION ITEMS 5.1 LAB's Library 
 usage poll 5.2 Kunde Fund Bequest Summary: The current balance of funds on
  deposit is $248\,849. 5.3 Review of LAB By-Laws 5.4 Outreach ideas 5.5 Yo
 uth LAB member 5.6 LAB recruitment 5.7 Updates from LAB members on current
