 rovided by Ehlers Estate\n\nGabriela Lena Frank \\(b. 1972\\): Leyendas: A
 n Andean Walkabout\n\nSunmi Chang\, Daria T. Adams\, violin\n\nMasumi Rost
 ad\, viola\n\nAnne Richardson\, cello\n\nIgor Stravinsky \\(1882-1971\\): 
 Suite from The Soldier's Tale for Violin\, Clarinet and Piano\n\nJason Iss
 okson\, violin\n\nJulian Bliss\, clarinet\n\nEvren Ozel\, piano\n\nFor the
  most up-to-date program\, artist info\, and ticket availability\, click t
 he ticket link to visit the event page.\n\nThis concert is presented as pa
 rt of the 32nd Annual Season of the Napa Valley Chamber Music Festival fro
 m August 2-23\, 2026. To learn more about Music in the Vineyards and the 2
 026 festival\, navigate to https://www.musicinthevineyards.org/events/?utm
