SUMMARY:Ani DiFranco Concert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T213000
UID:260530rQn9UHui10aFdVDCds-rww
DESCRIPTION:Ani DiFranco is bringing the Spirit of Love to Gundlach Bundsc
 hu Winery with Special Guest Valerie June – Presented by \\(\\(\\(folkYe
 ah!\\)\\)\\) and Gundlach Bundschu on Sunday August 16\, 2026 at 6:30pm at
  the Gundlach Bundschu Amphitheater in Sonoma\, CA.\n\nWHEN: Sunday\, Augu
 st 16th 2026 \n\nWHERE: GB Amphitheater \n\nTIME: Doors 5:30pm | Show 6:30
 pm \n\nBUY TICKETS\n\n// SOLD OUT // Pre-paid parking is still available t
 o ticket holders. $20 at entry\, $16.50 pre-paid. Paid Parking is not requ
 ired Bacchus club members and electric vehicle or carpooling with 3\\+. \n
 \nChildren 5 and under are free and do not require a ticket. For safety\, 
 infants or babies in arms are not permitted. \n\nFood available for purcha
 se \\(vendors will be announced prior to the show\\) \n\n  \n\nTICKETING:
 \n\nHave your ticket ready when you arrive! If you opted for mobile delive
 ry\, please make sure it’s ready to go on your phone. Printed tickets? H
 ave them out and ready to be scanned. Bacchus Club members\, enjoy express
  entry with your special line. \n\nPARKING:\n\nParking is complimentary fo
 r Bacchus Wine Club members. To encourage carpooling\, we offer free parki
 ng to vehicles with 3\\+ passengers\, full 2-seaters\, motorcycles\, and e
 lectric vehicles. Otherwise\, parking will be $16.50 pre-paid in advance o
 r $20 \\(cash only\\) at entry. For ADA accommodations please let the park
 ing attendant know. \n\nPLEASE NO:\n\nCoolers\n\nWater \\(bring an empty b
 ottle as we have filtered re-fill stations\\)\n\nPets\n\nChairs with legs 
 of any length \\(stadium seats that sit flat on the ground are permitted\\
 )\n\nOutside food or drink\n\nBad Attitudes… this is Rhinefarm after al
 l\n\nACCESSIBILITY:\n\nFor any questions regarding ADA accommodations rela
 ted to parking\, seating\, restrooms\, etc. please contact us at info@gunb
 un.com or 707.938.5277. \n\nYOUR EXPERIENCE\, YOUR ADVENTURE:\n\nAt Gundla
 ch Bundschu Winery\, we invite you to immerse yourself in the magic of our
  historic Redwood Barn\, where the beauty of nature blends with unforgetta
 ble performances. As with all great adventures\, attending an outdoor even
 t carries a touch of unpredictability. \n\nWhether it’s the rustle of th
 e vines in the breeze\, the gentle slope of the hillside\, or the surprise
 s nature has in store\, we encourage you to embrace the moment. While we s
 trive to create a safe and enjoyable environment\, the great outdoors brin
 gs its own set of risks. By joining us\, you understand and accept the inh
 erent possibilities\, but not limited to\, uneven ground\, changing weathe
 r\, and the occasional visit from our local wildlife. We ask that you trea
 d carefully\, come prepared for all conditions\, and remember to look afte
 r yourself and your belongings. \n\nBy attending our events\, you acknowle
 dge that your participation is voluntary\, and you assume all responsibili
 ty for any personal injuries\, accidents\, or loss of property that may oc
 cur during your time with us. Gundlach Bundschu Winery and its team are de
 dicated to your safety\, but cannot be held liable for incidents that may 
 arise from the natural elements of this experience. \n\nIn purchasing a ti
 cket and joining us under the open sky\, you agree to these terms and rele
 ase Gundlach Bundschu Winery from any claims or liabilities associated wit
 h the inherent risks of an outdoor gathering. We look forward to sharing t
 his special place with you\, where every moment is part of the journey. \n
 \nMAKE SURE TO VISIT OUR VENUE INFORMATION PAGE – HERE\n\nVENUE MAP
LOCATION:GB Amphitheater
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/ani-difranco-concert/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
