BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sit & Stitch 3:30 to 5:30
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260817T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260817T173000
UID:260722W9SKN2D7Nku4U29GgLHa2A
DESCRIPTION:Sit & Stitch on every Monday starting on Monday\, July 13th be
 tween 3:30 and 5:30 PM. You can drop in for any amount of time. We have th
 e supplies to help people get started on needle felting\, knitting\, macra
 me\, and crocheting. We will also have tea\, so bring your favorite covere
 d drink container. Sit and Stitch is for people to come and work on any fi
 ber arts activity that they have while visiting with others. Most people w
 ill bring their own projects\, but we always have hooks\, needles\, and ya
 rn and sometimes we will offer a project with instructions that people may
  choose to make. Let us know what you would like to learn this year. We no
 w have a working sewing machine for people to use. For beginners\, I will 
 bring is some fabric to make pillowcases. If you have a project that you w
 ould like to work on\, bring in your fabric and thread and you can use the
  machine. We share ideas\, skills\, and encouragement with each other. Thi
 s summer we will be adding\, weaving\, and decorative mending to our regul
 ar projects of knitting and crocheting. Children can come if they are acco
 mpanied one to one with an adult.
LOCATION:Guerneville Regional Library
URL:https://events.sonomalibrary.org/event/sit-stitch-330-530-116169
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
